        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/c48e17ee5fad4ddd5bd70d15f8d7e6ca.poster.avif?t=1764353912\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/c48e17ee5fad4ddd5bd70d15f8d7e6ca.webm?t=1764353912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/c48e17ee5fad4ddd5bd70d15f8d7e6ca.mp4?t=1764353912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A storm is coming, but umbrellas won’t help – it’s going to rain SAWBLADES!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, jump and somersault over razor-sharp sawblades in an attempt to survive the deadly storm! Compete in the global leaderboard for the spot of the best blade-jumper. Unlock quirky and outlandish characters to join in the blade jumping mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/df670c15dbe3dd214ae377e62c4c4b80.avif?t=1764353912\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock several dozen characters, sawblades and backgrounds. Customize the visuals to your liking - play as a dinosaur avoiding meteorites, or as a ninja dodging ninja stars! Go wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/04a94eddb97bdf903d2d98dfe4b4bc57.poster.avif?t=1764353912\" width=616 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/04a94eddb97bdf903d2d98dfe4b4bc57.webm?t=1764353912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/04a94eddb97bdf903d2d98dfe4b4bc57.mp4?t=1764353912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/061e798fef66ec5e1cab0dc14c4500f0.avif?t=1764353912\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over sawblades to score points. Do it fast to regain time and delay the inevitable Sudden Death!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player character is invisible in this mode! Rely on your superior spatial reasoning skills to survive in this unforgiving mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barrage Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once spawned, every sawblade stays in the room forever. This mode is the very definition of the word &quot;Overwhelming&quot;!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/741647ff39fc8e295d771d47bdb2449d.poster.avif?t=1764353912\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/741647ff39fc8e295d771d47bdb2449d.webm?t=1764353912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/741647ff39fc8e295d771d47bdb2449d.mp4?t=1764353912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/3dcfbddc75259d76a5aa7808083770ca.avif?t=1764353912\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based score-chasing action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed arcade gameplay with time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juicy 8-bit style music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Slight Chance of Sawblades is a labor of love from a mostly solo game developer.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/c48e17ee5fad4ddd5bd70d15f8d7e6ca.poster.avif?t=1764353912\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/c48e17ee5fad4ddd5bd70d15f8d7e6ca.webm?t=1764353912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/c48e17ee5fad4ddd5bd70d15f8d7e6ca.mp4?t=1764353912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A storm is coming, but umbrellas won’t help – it’s going to rain SAWBLADES!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, jump and somersault over razor-sharp sawblades in an attempt to survive the deadly storm! Compete in the global leaderboard for the spot of the best blade-jumper. Unlock quirky and outlandish characters to join in the blade jumping mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/df670c15dbe3dd214ae377e62c4c4b80.avif?t=1764353912\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock several dozen characters, sawblades and backgrounds. Customize the visuals to your liking - play as a dinosaur avoiding meteorites, or as a ninja dodging ninja stars! Go wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/04a94eddb97bdf903d2d98dfe4b4bc57.poster.avif?t=1764353912\" width=616 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/04a94eddb97bdf903d