 src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/3dcfbddc75259d76a5aa7808083770ca.avif?t=1764353912\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based score-chasing action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed arcade gameplay with time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juicy 8-bit style music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Slight Chance of Sawblades is a labor of love from a mostly solo game developer.</p>",
